{# Variables: summary (PerPaperSummary dict), passages (list[{paper_id, text}]) #}
You are a fact-check verifier. Check each claim in SUMMARY against PASSAGES.

SUMMARY:
{{ summary | tojson(indent=2) }}

PASSAGES (ground truth):
{% for p in passages %}
[P{{ p.paper_id }}-{{ loop.index }}] {{ p.text }}
{% endfor %}

For each distinct claim in the summary, emit one verdict:
  - supported:   claim matches cited passage content
  - partial:     claim matches part of the cited passage; some parts unsupported
  - unsupported: claim not backed by any cited passage

OUTPUT: STRICT JSON matching VerifierVerdict:
  - claims: [{claim_text, citations, verdict, reason}, ...]
